# 约定(2026-09-23 重写, 对齐 api/order/v1 的 proto):
#   直连 = http://{host}:{port}, 身份由 x-md-global-user-id 头模拟网关注入;
#   网关 = {gateway_scheme}://{gateway_host}(LAN) 或 https://{public_gateway_host}(公网), 带 Authorization: Bearer {token}。
#   变量在 http-client.env.json(dev)。host 用 [::1]: 127.0.0.1:30001/30002/30003 被 GoLand/WebStorm/JCEF 占着。

### healthz
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/healthz
Content-Type: application/json

### CreateOrder(直连; proto 字段名就是 PascalCase 的 CartItemIds(JSON 键同名), 值是 cart.cart_item.id, seed 里 1/2 属于 user_id)
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/order.v1.orderService/CreateOrder
Content-Type: application/json
x-md-global-user-id: {{user_id}}

{
  "CartItemIds": [1],
  "addressId": "{{address_id}}",
  "remark": "http-client 测试单"
}

### CreateOrder 参数校验(空 cartItemIds → 400 invalid_argument)
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/order.v1.orderService/CreateOrder
Content-Type: application/json
x-md-global-user-id: {{user_id}}

{"CartItemIds": [], "addressId": ""}

### CompleteOrder(seed 订单)
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/order.v1.orderService/CompleteOrder
Content-Type: application/json
x-md-global-user-id: {{user_id}}

{"orderNo": "{{order_no}}"}

### CreateOrder(LAN 网关)
POST {{gateway_scheme}}://{{gateway_host}}/order.v1.orderService/CreateOrder
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{"CartItemIds": [1], "addressId": "{{address_id}}"}
